## 2. Tech Stack Mapping

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend | Next.js 14+ (App Router) | SSR, Client Components, Routing |
| Styling | CSS Modules / Vanilla CSS | Scoped styling, no external deps |
| Backend | Next.js API Routes | Order creation, payment verification, webhooks |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL) | Donor data, donation records, causes |
| Auth | Supabase Auth | Admin login, JWT sessions |
| Payments | Razorpay (Test Mode) | Payment gateway, checkout, webhooks |
| Hosting | Vercel | Deployment, serverless functions |

