## 3. Page Architecture

### Public Pages (No Auth)
```
/ (Home / Donation Page)
├── Cause display (fetched from Supabase)
├── Predefined amount buttons (₹100, ₹500, ₹1000, ₹2000)
├── Custom amount input
├── Donor info form (name, email, phone)
└── "Donate Now" button → Razorpay Checkout

/thank-you
├── Success message
├── Donation summary (amount, reference ID)
├── Share buttons (optional)
└── "Donate Again" link
```

### Admin Pages (Auth Required)
```
/admin/login
├── Email + Password form
└── Supabase Auth sign-in

/admin (Dashboard)
├── Total donations count
├── Total amount raised
├── Recent donations list
└── Date range filter

/admin/donors
├── Searchable donor table
├── Columns: Name, Email, Amount, Date, Payment ID
├── Export option (optional)
└── Pagination
```

