## 5. Data Flow — Donation Journey

```
Step 1: User visits / (Donation Page)
  → Next.js SSR fetches active cause from Supabase
  → Renders cause info + donation form

Step 2: User fills form + clicks "Donate Now"
  → Client calls POST /api/create-order
  → Server creates Razorpay order
  → Client opens Razorpay Checkout popup

Step 3: User completes payment in Razorpay
  → Razorpay returns payment response to client
  → Client calls POST /api/verify-payment
  → Server verifies signature
  → Server inserts donation into Supabase (status: 'pending')
  → Client redirects to /thank-you?id=donation_id

Step 4: Razorpay sends webhook
  → POST /api/webhook/razorpay
  → Server verifies webhook signature
  → Updates donation status to 'completed' or 'failed'

Step 5: Admin views /admin
  → Fetches donations from Supabase
  → Displays donor log with filters
```

